  "prefLabel": "Rev 413.05 Verification",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 413.05 Verification. The municipal assessing officials may request true copies of any documents as needed to verify eligibility for the property tax exemptions having net income or net asset limitations.\n\nSource. #12027, eff 10-28-16; renumbered by #12925 (formerly Rev 412.05)",
